delete/1=ignore/2=ignore ermes.<pr st er> ermes
string/k

xeq/s link/udf/ring=0/nbot=32768/o==ermes/e==ermes.er/supst%/%&
  <sys z cli32 speed pln x pl1 dgl clre link sed c xyzzy masm&
  f77 lang_rt>ermes pl1ermes16 %-%

[!nequal,([!string]),()]
   string ** Error on %0%. Error is: [!string] **
   write [!string]
   type ermes.er
[!else]
   delete/2=ignore ermes.er
   rename ermes<.pr,>
   acl ermes + re
[!end]
